  "body": "`crates/ui/src/viewport.rs` has 1270 lines on PR #2989 (head bdea342b6). The AGENTS.md \"400-line files\" rule permits about 400 lines.\n\nPR #2989 makes the file smaller (1543 to 1270 lines). It moves the pipelines and targets to `viewport/pipes.rs` and the wide lines to `viewport/wide.rs`. The review of #2989 asked for a follow-up issue for the remaining lines.\n\nPossible seams (to be confirmed when the work starts):\n- the WGSL shader text;\n- the buffer upload code (document mesh, overlay, palette);\n- the render pass and the draw list loop;\n- the `View3D` state and its small accessors.\n\nThe split moves code only. It must not change the rendered output. The test count of `crates/ui` must not go down.\n\nFound while working on #2989.\n\nProposed labels (a contributor cannot set labels): `P7`, `effort:medium`, `area:ui`, `source:agent`.\n\nDone means: each file under `crates/ui/src/viewport*` has about 400 lines or fewer, and the `camcraft-ui` tests and clippy are green.\n",
